{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-2", "avgTag": "行動後", "storyName": "命定的終點", "storyInfo": "第一神殿的克瑞斯拉雕像完工，在雕像前，緹緹想到了舉辦文物交換儀式的最佳地點。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g12_generalroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#6$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊——", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#6$2"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……啊……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不錯，呼吸道和發聲系統一切正常，肺部的結晶沒有造成逆行感染。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也就是說，幾天前你到羅德島辦事處，緊盯著我們的醫療幹員一言不發，不是因為病情加重說不出話。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看來我本不必特地跑這一趟。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萊娜小姐，您很關心雅賽努斯的感染者，羅德島帶來的藥物也遠比我們之前服用的有效，我們都很感激，我就不耽誤您的時間了……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是做個檢查還不夠。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "米諾斯對感染者的政策可謂寬鬆，除了不能從事神職等特殊職業，感染者的日常生活並不會受到太大影響。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但“礦石病會隔絕米諾斯人的英雄氣概”是很多人信奉的真理。不少患者對自己的病情態度消極，甚至有人刻意隱瞞。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "告訴我，呂刻伊昂先生，這是幾？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "四。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萊娜小姐，承蒙關心，您還是請回吧。我只是輕度感染，病痛還未波及我的視力。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那這半個月來，你為何光顧了羅德島辦事處整整四次？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你太不擅長說謊，而且我在你的老師贊索斯先生身上看到了羅德島出品的監測手環。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你一直在替他求醫？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老師每日操心的事太多，總是忘了複診。我幫他拿藥也很合理。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你沒有在辦事處登記他的名字，這代表他不會留下礦石病的醫療記錄。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$2"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他救了我的命，教我水文知識和戰鬥的技藝，待我不薄。他是值得尊敬的前輩，所以我覺得不該讓更多人知道……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "知道他與“英雄”無緣？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$2"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#13$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呂刻伊昂先生，出入感染者治療中心或許會影響別人對贊索斯先生和你的判斷，但不會改變你們選擇的路。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#13$2"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不是卡珊卓拉小姐，並不擅長安撫人心，但我知道你們兩個急需妥善的治療。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我會調整你們在感染者治療名單上的優先順序，密切關注你們的病情。做好被我叨擾的準備吧，倔強的年輕人。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您……並沒有看起來那麼好說話。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你跟你弓箭上站著的小羽獸一樣，用幾粒甜玉米就能收買，我就不必費那麼多口舌了。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對了，贊索斯先生呢？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你之前帶來的報告都是他的，那這段時間他體內的結晶密度波動劇烈，需要充分的休息。我叮囑過你。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我向老師轉述了，但……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#13$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他不會又去渡口了吧？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#13$2"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g1_rivercrossing", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "果農和工匠的船隻還沒安排好，我現在很忙。長話短說吧，赫卡德墨。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……呂刻伊昂怎麼沒來幫您？平時他不會離開您半步的啊。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "家裡來了個羅德島的醫生，正在幫他看病，請假了。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "上門看病？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（難道他上次拿的藥依舊沒有效果，現在已經病到……沒辦法走路了？）", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#14$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你是來傳達里底婭理事官的“建議”，那還是請回吧。我會解決渡口的問題，不用她操心。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#14$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這次理事官派我來就是想通知您，渡口的問題已經徹底解決了。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "解決了？帕拉斯這次動作還蠻快的嘛。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，給出解決方案的人並不是她。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是誰？是卡珊卓拉小姐出面穩定了人心？還是理事官動用了她的小手段？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "都不是。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "解決工匠和果農紛爭的是薩爾貢使節團的大使，一位深色皮膚、黑色耳朵的小個子菲林。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "黑色耳朵的菲林……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.8, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "69_i02"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.0, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g1_rivercrossing", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那天早上在次級渡口遇到的“哥倫比亞人”……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就是薩爾貢的使節？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g8_templetheater", "screenadapt": "showall", "x": 0.0, "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "backgroundTween", "attributes": {"xFrom": 0.0, "xTo": 0.0, "yTo": 0.0, "xScaleFrom": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "xScaleTo": 1.4, "yScaleTo": 1.4, "duration": 105.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$path_intro", "key": "$path_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "古老的米諾斯人從潔白的大理石中發現了美，用楔子、石鑿、銼刀……塑造傳說和史詩。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "《克瑞斯拉紀》中寫道，建國英雄克瑞斯拉磨損了整整三十雙鞋，歷經戰爭和瘟疫，來到四面環山的花園。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她在舊第一神殿原址的所在地見到山石開裂，領受了神諭。", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她溫柔與智慧的面龐映著雅賽努斯的晨光，她庇護追隨她的難民，用利刃驅逐異邦人，而她的琴聲——", "name": "緹緹"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“只為英雄的故事而響！”", "name": "緹緹&帕拉斯"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g8_templetheater"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你對《克瑞斯拉紀》也這麼熟悉？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因為喜歡，所以讀過很多遍，我心中對米諾斯英雄的最初印象，就來自這首敘事長詩裡的克瑞斯拉。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“英雄代表正義感與同情心——”", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#14$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“英雄需要在命運到來的時刻，擁有坦然面對它、承擔自己責任的勇氣。”", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#14$2"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你確實很瞭解這部作品。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再怎麼盯著印刷出來的書籍，也比不上親自站在克瑞斯拉的雕像之下啊。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然雕像的創作者在這個作品中特地誇大了克瑞斯拉所能引發的神蹟，哪怕這並非她原本的源石技藝——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但或許就是這個誇張的藝術，讓這座雕像栩栩如生，我甚至能想像到千百年後它依然屹立在這片豐饒的土地上……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是不是在想，要是克瑞斯拉第一神殿能按這座雕像的品質完工，哪怕再等待十幾年也無妨？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也不會這麼想。在我交換完文物離開米諾斯之前，還是想多看一點的。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在克瑞斯拉的雕像已經落成，觀眾席的石階也修整好了？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，多虧你的提議。果農加入採石隊伍之後，為了儘快讓種植區的蘋果樹得到充足的日曬，他們比工匠還要努力，石材數量提高了不少。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "用於修建正殿的石材竟然先被調來整修露天劇場？雖然在書中讀到過，但米諾斯人對戲劇的熱愛真是令人吃驚……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "英雄自民眾中來，民眾也渴望成為英雄，哪怕只是在戲裡。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你剛剛已經認出了這座雕像的出典？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "《克瑞斯拉與異邦人》——出自《克瑞斯拉紀》的第十一章，後來被改編成一齣非常著名的古典戲劇，常用於神殿奉請英雄的祭祀儀式。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過奇怪的是，前幾天我參觀了幾座小型劇場，劇目表裡有各種悲喜劇，唯獨沒見到這齣戲。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "難道這類用於祭祀儀式的戲劇，不能在普通劇場上演？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，《克瑞斯拉與異邦人》確實是傳統儀式常用的劇目之一。但是，哪怕在神殿，它也已經有百年沒有上演過了。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "百年……難道是因為……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯，它在薩爾貢占領期間被禁演。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原本這個劇本講述的是米諾斯建國之前的故事，異邦人指的也只是非古阿加門王國的外鄉人。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但薩爾貢的帕夏禁止了這部劇的上演，劇中被克瑞斯拉處決的異邦人也就有了明確的影射對象。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如今禁令不再，但在這部劇中飾演異邦人，也就相當於飾演薩爾貢人，沒有一個雅賽努斯人會願意這麼做。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "太可惜了……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "或許吧，不過戲劇對於米諾斯人而言不僅僅是賞玩的藝術品。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "禁演也好，焚毀劇場也罷，劇本書寫的是歷史傳說，字裡行間飽含的英雄氣概是無法被刻意遺忘的。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕無人願意出演，劇中的樂曲也在大街小巷銷聲匿跡，雅賽努斯人還是能背出其中最著名的橋段，這就夠了。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "第一神殿在戰火中損毀，《克瑞斯拉與異邦人》被禁演……不管怎麼說，薩爾貢確實為米諾斯平添了許多災難。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕夏派我交還米諾斯的文物，這與其說是一種微不足道的彌補，不如說更像是政客的表態……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是護送文物的薩爾貢使節，家世不夠顯赫，資歷也不夠深厚，說實話能做到的不多。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我還是法爾賈萬達巴德博物館的館長，知識不會背叛我。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我深知自己帶來的文物與克瑞斯拉有密切的關聯，對米諾斯有重大的意義……它不該只是一件政治籌碼。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹抬頭仰望，聖潔優美的克瑞斯拉像矗立在她的面前，撥弄著手中的豎琴。"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她彷彿聽到了只為英雄而響的琴聲縈繞在自己的耳邊，那些她如數家珍的傳說和故事出現在她眼前。"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕這裡只是一座剛剛完工的神殿劇場，鷹架和幕布煞風景地堆放在一邊，但透過它們，緹緹領會到了一些特殊的東西——"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那些被書寫在史詩中，留存在大理石和工匠手中的傳統，那些歷經百年，不為任何事物屈服的、只屬於米諾斯的東西，就在這裡。"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想在這裡舉辦文物交換儀式。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦？倒是個不錯的想法，不過……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "none"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，這裡是克瑞斯拉第一神殿，大小事務須與神殿祭司先行商議。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉？你今天怎麼有空來重建工地？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 225, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉打擾你們的談話，尊敬的使節小姐，有些事情我需要單獨跟帕拉斯商量。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}